{
  "id": "FreeIndexNowPing01",
  "name": "Auto IndexNow Ping for New Blog Posts (Bing + AI Search)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "6bda86bd-3097-410e-98fc-1bb8e6b12a99",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -224,
        -256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 768,
        "content": "## Auto IndexNow Ping for New Blog Posts (Bing + AI Search)\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow watches an RSS feed for newly published blog posts and automatically notifies IndexNow so search engines can discover the URL faster. It prepares the required site host and IndexNow key, posts the ping to the IndexNow API, then branches based on whether the request succeeded. The final nodes mark either a successful ping or a failed ping that likely needs key or configuration review.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the RSS Trigger with the blog feed URL to monitor for new posts.\n- Set the correct siteHost value in the Configure node, matching the domain being submitted to IndexNow.\n- Add a valid IndexNow key in the Configure node and ensure the key file is hosted on the site as required by IndexNow.\n- Verify the HTTP Request node posts to https://api.indexnow.org/indexnow with the expected host, key, and URL payload.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can add notifications, logging, or retry handling after the success and failure branches, and adjust the RSS feed or IndexNow endpoint if using a different supported provider."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "bc4a00bb-79ab-4777-a784-4053d3a4b637",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        336,
        -112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Detect and configure post\n\nStarts when the RSS feed reports a new blog post, then sets the site host and IndexNow key needed for the ping request."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ebf48904-61fb-48cf-ae99-6b9425ce7b80",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        800,
        -112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Submit and verify ping\n\nSends the new post URL to the IndexNow API and checks whether the response indicates a successful submission."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8951c5c9-6f66-4dc7-9777-693a039fb26c",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1248,
        -256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 240,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## Handle ping outcome\n\nProvides separate terminal paths for successful pings and failed pings, with the failure path indicating the IndexNow key should be checked."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "rss-trigger",
      "name": "When New Blog Post Published",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedReadTrigger",
      "position": [
        380,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "feedUrl": "https://YOUR-SITE.com/feed/",
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyX",
              "unit": "minutes",
              "value": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "configure",
      "name": "Set Host and API Key",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        600,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-host",
              "name": "siteHost",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "YOUR-SITE.com"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-key",
              "name": "indexnowKey",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "PASTE-YOUR-INDEXNOW-KEY-HERE"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "indexnow-ping",
      "name": "Post to IndexNow API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        848,
        48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.indexnow.org/indexnow",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        },
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ host: $json.siteHost, key: $json.indexnowKey, keyLocation: 'https://' + $json.siteHost + '/' + $json.indexnowKey + '.txt', urlList: [ $('When New Blog Post Published').item.json.link ] }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "check-status",
      "name": "If API Call Successful",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        1072,
        48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-ok",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lt"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "rightValue": 300
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "noop-ok",
      "name": "Log Ping Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "position": [
        1296,
        -32
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "noop-fail",
      "name": "Log Ping Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "position": [
        1296,
        144
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
    "Post to IndexNow API": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "If API Call Successful",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set Host and API Key": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post to IndexNow API",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "If API Call Successful": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log Ping Success",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Log Ping Failure",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "When New Blog Post Published": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set Host and API Key",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "meta": {
    "site": "https://github.com/zengfr/n8n-workflow-all-templates",
